WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.563 --> 00:00:04.260
(water bubbling and gushing)

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:05.740
- [Johnny] 40 million years ago,

00:00:05.740 --> 00:00:07.670
the ocean floor cracked open

00:00:07.670 --> 00:00:10.550
and molten lava started flowing out.

00:00:10.550 --> 00:00:14.110
It cooled as it hit the cold
ocean water and turned solid,

00:00:14.110 --> 00:00:16.503
eventually making mountains in the ocean.

00:00:18.399 --> 00:00:21.010
Those mountains got taller and taller,

00:00:21.010 --> 00:00:23.783
and soon a chain of islands was born.

00:00:24.660 --> 00:00:26.620
And then, around 2000 years ago,

00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:30.370
a group of people arrived
to these islands in canoes.

00:00:30.370 --> 00:00:34.410
Those communities eventually
unified into one kingdom,

00:00:34.410 --> 00:00:35.510
the kingdom of Hawaii.

00:00:37.740 --> 00:00:40.440
A sovereign nation in the
middle of the Pacific Ocean.

00:00:41.590 --> 00:00:45.260
Hawaii became a language, a
culture, a national identity.

00:00:45.260 --> 00:00:47.340
But that sovereignty, that culture,

00:00:47.340 --> 00:00:49.433
that identity was soon stolen,

00:00:51.310 --> 00:00:54.544
captured by a new, bigger
country, an ocean away.

00:00:54.544 --> 00:00:57.365
(rapid ticking)
(sinister music)

00:00:57.365 --> 00:00:59.842
- [Man] This is the
story of these islands.

00:00:59.842 --> 00:01:02.592
(sinister music)

00:01:05.912 --> 00:01:09.790
- [Man] For millions of
years, there was no land here.

00:01:09.790 --> 00:01:10.987
Only the sea.

00:01:12.150 --> 00:01:14.440
- [Man] Hawaii's half century
old request for statehood

00:01:14.440 --> 00:01:15.500
is granted.

00:01:19.350 --> 00:01:20.500
- [Johnny] The Kingdom of Hawaii

00:01:20.500 --> 00:01:23.540
remained a fairly remote
disconnected country

00:01:23.540 --> 00:01:26.757
for many years, until these guys arrived.

00:01:26.757 --> 00:01:28.976
During the 1700 and 1800's,

00:01:28.976 --> 00:01:31.710
many people from Europe
and the United States

00:01:31.710 --> 00:01:33.400
came to visit Hawaii,

00:01:33.400 --> 00:01:35.890
mainly on expeditions
of exploring the ocean.

00:01:35.890 --> 00:01:38.425
But the ones that stayed
were mainly Americans

00:01:38.425 --> 00:01:40.260
who arrived to these islands

00:01:40.260 --> 00:01:42.010
wanting to talk about Jesus.

00:01:42.010 --> 00:01:42.843
For the most part,

00:01:42.843 --> 00:01:44.708
the Kingdom of Hawaii
welcomed these visitors.

00:01:44.708 --> 00:01:46.160
One British Explorer

00:01:46.160 --> 00:01:48.930
even gifted the Hawaiian
King a British flag

00:01:48.930 --> 00:01:51.540
and Hawaii eventually
adopted the British flag

00:01:51.540 --> 00:01:52.800
into their own flag.

00:01:52.800 --> 00:01:55.826
There was general friendship
and good relations here.

00:01:55.826 --> 00:01:59.500
The American missionaries
who had settled on the island

00:01:59.500 --> 00:02:01.520
eventually had kids and grandkids.

00:02:01.520 --> 00:02:04.070
And soon these missionaries
and their descendants

00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:06.376
weren't just interested
in talking about Jesus.

00:02:06.376 --> 00:02:09.810
They were also interested
in building businesses,

00:02:09.810 --> 00:02:11.440
mainly focused on sugar.

00:02:11.440 --> 00:02:13.950
- [Man] By far the most
valuable single product

00:02:13.950 --> 00:02:17.270
Hawaii can offer in that trade is sugar.

00:02:17.270 --> 00:02:19.540
- [Johnny] With this
increased economic interest,

00:02:19.540 --> 00:02:22.940
these Americans who had
originally come to be missionaries

00:02:22.940 --> 00:02:25.050
were now much more into sugar,

00:02:25.050 --> 00:02:27.640
and they did what people
of European descent

00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:29.540
have been doing for many centuries,

00:02:29.540 --> 00:02:31.270
looking at a culture and government

00:02:31.270 --> 00:02:33.236
that is different than theirs and saying,

00:02:33.236 --> 00:02:35.252
we think we could do this better,

00:02:35.252 --> 00:02:37.130
let us take it from here.

00:02:37.130 --> 00:02:38.860
And so during the 1800's,

00:02:38.860 --> 00:02:41.400
these Americans slowly chipped away

00:02:41.400 --> 00:02:43.350
at the Hawaiian government structure.

00:02:43.350 --> 00:02:46.901
They were still newcomers in
this ancient Island nation.

00:02:46.901 --> 00:02:48.690
They didn't have much power.

00:02:48.690 --> 00:02:50.326
But that changed quickly.

00:02:50.326 --> 00:02:53.027
- [Man] The Pacific
always comes rolling in.

00:02:53.027 --> 00:02:55.657
Mile upon mile dazzling white beachs.

00:02:55.657 --> 00:02:57.380
- [Johnny] By the end of the 1800's,

00:02:57.380 --> 00:02:59.680
these Jesus sugar Americans

00:02:59.680 --> 00:03:02.150
had amassed a huge
amount of Hawaii's wealth

00:03:02.150 --> 00:03:03.610
and those original missionaries

00:03:03.610 --> 00:03:04.810
who had come to the Island

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:07.180
to convert people to their
religion years earlier

00:03:07.180 --> 00:03:10.856
now had grandkids that looked like this,

00:03:10.856 --> 00:03:15.050
a full on armed militia of
white Hawaiian citizens,

00:03:15.050 --> 00:03:16.590
descendants of the missionaries,

00:03:16.590 --> 00:03:18.900
who were eager to get the
government out of the way

00:03:18.900 --> 00:03:21.131
so that they could run
the country themselves

00:03:21.131 --> 00:03:24.870
and help make it more favorable
for their sugar businesses.

00:03:24.870 --> 00:03:27.540
Now, remember, these
guys were born in Hawaii.

00:03:27.540 --> 00:03:29.690
They considered themselves the Hawaiians.

00:03:29.690 --> 00:03:30.550
But even still,

00:03:30.550 --> 00:03:34.640
their loyalty still lie with
the country of their ancestors.

00:03:34.640 --> 00:03:36.520
They were effectively Americans still.

00:03:36.520 --> 00:03:40.990
By 1893, this local white militia
and their political allies

00:03:40.990 --> 00:03:43.980
were ready for a full on
takeover of the government,

00:03:43.980 --> 00:03:46.520
which at the time was
headed by this woman,

00:03:46.520 --> 00:03:48.250
Queen Lili'uokalani.

00:03:48.250 --> 00:03:51.180
The sugar missionaries
were still a minority

00:03:51.180 --> 00:03:53.360
and a full on overthrow of the government

00:03:53.360 --> 00:03:55.160
would have been hard by themselves.

00:03:55.160 --> 00:03:57.300
But luckily for them, they had help.

00:03:57.300 --> 00:03:59.970
The American ambassador
of Hawaii at the time

00:03:59.970 --> 00:04:01.560
helped coordinate the arrival

00:04:01.560 --> 00:04:04.410
of an American military ship and troops

00:04:04.410 --> 00:04:07.130
to show up on the shores
of the Island of a Oahu

00:04:07.130 --> 00:04:09.160
into the capital city of Honolulu.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:10.500
Up until this point,

00:04:10.500 --> 00:04:13.430
the conflict in Hawaii
was technically internal,

00:04:13.430 --> 00:04:16.880
meaning it was between the
locals and the white missionaries

00:04:16.880 --> 00:04:18.080
who were technically locals

00:04:18.080 --> 00:04:19.030
because they were born there.

00:04:19.030 --> 00:04:21.460
But the moment the US arrived to Honolulu

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:24.700
to provide military backup
for a government overthrow,

00:04:24.700 --> 00:04:27.248
it became a full line military coup

00:04:27.248 --> 00:04:29.470
sponsored by a foreign power,

00:04:29.470 --> 00:04:32.300
a Cardinal sin in international relations.

00:04:32.300 --> 00:04:35.120
But even still the government
backed the overthrow.

00:04:35.120 --> 00:04:37.160
The queen was forced to give up her power

00:04:37.160 --> 00:04:38.570
and they put this guy

00:04:38.570 --> 00:04:41.140
as the leader of the
new Republic of Hawaii.

00:04:41.140 --> 00:04:42.826
His name was Sanford Dole.

00:04:42.826 --> 00:04:46.240
His family was huge in the sugar business.

00:04:46.240 --> 00:04:48.960
- [Man] There's a new taste
in pineapple from Dole.

00:04:48.960 --> 00:04:50.290
- [Johnny] And now he was the leader

00:04:50.290 --> 00:04:51.790
of the country of Hawaii.

00:04:51.790 --> 00:04:54.640
The locals fought this but peacefully.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:55.920
They protested.

00:04:55.920 --> 00:04:58.030
Nearly every adult on the islands

00:04:58.030 --> 00:05:00.710
signed a petition condemning the takeover.

00:05:00.710 --> 00:05:01.920
Back in Washington DC,

00:05:01.920 --> 00:05:04.810
a debate began as to
what to do with Hawaii

00:05:04.810 --> 00:05:07.240
now that a bunch of
pro-American missionaries

00:05:07.240 --> 00:05:09.510
turned sugar warriors had grabbed power.

00:05:09.510 --> 00:05:12.320
Dole himself traveled to DC to lobby

00:05:12.320 --> 00:05:15.570
for the US to take over
Hawaii for themselves.

00:05:15.570 --> 00:05:17.460
But so did a group of local Hawaiians

00:05:17.460 --> 00:05:19.610
to oppose the American encroachment.

00:05:19.610 --> 00:05:21.210
The queen who was overthrown

00:05:21.210 --> 00:05:23.760
wrote a letter demanding to be reinstated

00:05:23.760 --> 00:05:26.530
as the legitimate leader
of the Kingdom of Hawaii.

00:05:26.530 --> 00:05:30.120
The United States was split
on what to do until 1898

00:05:30.120 --> 00:05:32.790
when the new president
surrounded himself with leaders

00:05:32.790 --> 00:05:35.860
who kind of loved war
and American expansion.

00:05:35.860 --> 00:05:38.770
And this is what sealed
the fate of Hawaii.

00:05:38.770 --> 00:05:42.180
All of these displays of
vehement peaceful protests

00:05:42.180 --> 00:05:43.500
by the Hawaiian people

00:05:43.500 --> 00:05:46.587
were trampled on by a
superpower who had bigger guns

00:05:46.587 --> 00:05:49.653
and an insatiable desire for control.

00:05:51.481 --> 00:05:55.720
So one summer day in
1898, the US showed up

00:05:55.720 --> 00:05:58.641
and the flag of the Kingdom
Hawaii was taken down

00:05:58.641 --> 00:06:01.123
and the US flag was raised.

00:06:01.123 --> 00:06:04.530
Hawaii was now officially a possession

00:06:04.530 --> 00:06:07.010
of the United States of America.

00:06:07.010 --> 00:06:09.250
With the help of these
sugar loving missionaries,

00:06:09.250 --> 00:06:11.740
these islands had been
plucked from their people

00:06:11.740 --> 00:06:14.493
and put in the hands of
a growing superpower.

00:06:15.400 --> 00:06:17.400
But stealing land is one thing.

00:06:17.400 --> 00:06:20.419
The real theft is what happened next.

00:06:20.419 --> 00:06:21.550
(ominous music)

00:06:21.550 --> 00:06:25.270
At this point, Hawaii was just
a US territory, not a state,

00:06:25.270 --> 00:06:29.420
but even still the US began a
deep, widespread destruction

00:06:29.420 --> 00:06:30.880
of Hawaiian way of life.

00:06:30.880 --> 00:06:33.370
The Hawaiian language
was banned in schools

00:06:33.370 --> 00:06:36.220
and government and businesses were by law

00:06:36.220 --> 00:06:38.410
required to be conducted in English.

00:06:38.410 --> 00:06:42.630
The US began developing
land, often on sacred sites.

00:06:42.630 --> 00:06:45.430
And the history itself was censored

00:06:45.430 --> 00:06:47.440
to make it seem as if the Hawaiian people

00:06:47.440 --> 00:06:49.410
welcomed the US without a fight.

00:06:49.410 --> 00:06:52.300
Much of the real history
became inaccessible

00:06:52.300 --> 00:06:55.210
because it was only documented
in the Hawaiian language,

00:06:55.210 --> 00:06:56.700
which was beginning to die.

00:06:56.700 --> 00:07:01.400
And then in 1959, Hawaii became
the 50th state of the union

00:07:01.400 --> 00:07:04.318
and quickly became the
place we know today.

00:07:04.318 --> 00:07:06.901
(island music)

00:07:13.420 --> 00:07:15.650
Meanwhile, Dole food company,

00:07:15.650 --> 00:07:17.750
the company who was
perhaps helped the most

00:07:17.750 --> 00:07:18.850
by this land grab,

00:07:18.850 --> 00:07:21.410
has become a massive global corporation.

00:07:21.410 --> 00:07:25.545
By 1993, Hawaii was a full
on part of the United States.

00:07:25.545 --> 00:07:28.880
That year, President Bill
Clinton came out with an apology.

00:07:28.880 --> 00:07:30.654
- A Presidential apology.

00:07:30.654 --> 00:07:32.330
At the White House yesterday,

00:07:32.330 --> 00:07:34.980
President Clinton signed
a formal letter of apology

00:07:34.980 --> 00:07:36.308
to the people of Hawaii.

00:07:36.308 --> 00:07:39.120
He was apologizing on
behalf of the US government

00:07:39.120 --> 00:07:42.170
for the government's
involvement 100 years ago

00:07:42.170 --> 00:07:45.640
in removing the independent
Hawaiian monarchy by force.

00:07:45.640 --> 00:07:47.840
- But despite this horrendous land grab

00:07:47.840 --> 00:07:50.070
and the pillaging and
theft of these islands,

00:07:50.070 --> 00:07:51.673
there is a little bit of hope here.

00:07:51.673 --> 00:07:54.710
That spirit of peaceful resistance

00:07:54.710 --> 00:07:58.400
that led to petitions and
protests back in 1893,

00:07:58.400 --> 00:08:00.640
persisted, even after the takeover.

00:08:00.640 --> 00:08:03.790
The Hawaiian language
was delicately preserved

00:08:03.790 --> 00:08:05.326
through painstaking effort.

00:08:05.326 --> 00:08:07.560
And today there are full immersion

00:08:07.560 --> 00:08:09.456
Hawaiian language public schools.

00:08:09.456 --> 00:08:12.170
Hawaiian traditions have stayed alive.

00:08:12.170 --> 00:08:13.860
And last year Hawaiians showed

00:08:13.860 --> 00:08:17.200
that they were not willing to
give up their sacred sites.

00:08:17.200 --> 00:08:20.680
They staged a dramatic protest
to protect a Holy mountain

00:08:20.680 --> 00:08:22.510
that was slated to be developed on.

00:08:22.510 --> 00:08:24.170
Hawaii may have been stolen

00:08:24.170 --> 00:08:26.730
and attempts made to erase its culture,

00:08:26.730 --> 00:08:29.540
but while the negative effects
of this Imperial land grab

00:08:29.540 --> 00:08:30.710
are wide reaching,

00:08:30.710 --> 00:08:34.263
many pillars of this beautiful
culture have survived.

